{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:46:40.390931909Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"e68e3d51-bf03-40aa-8792-1c51f8c754aa","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"[action] Explored tripn-astro orchestrator.md + orchestrator-guard.ts, ASES hook-config by_type mechanism, plugin enforcement flow, opencode permission matcher semantics (wildcard ' *' matches bare+args), rtk rewrite behavior (git merge NOT rewritten, git commit→rtk git commit)","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:46:40.384037627Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAAHTkjo1mmA2mZRX1JRlytHjwcoekCyBNZtjHBgJTWtdlLOmYIXCseh8HByDM/OT0EAfHdOaFWmc3IF4eDwc3Dw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBk+VBRlD5lr6A7HlyZfygvi1j94g/gc+6GDU6ZXvfzx1cXEnlp7UbAVCzxCoIZjQeTb67tkn2FaWd/tUrVL4wo="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:46:44.663049623Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"5cb5920d-7e33-41a7-8cb4-79163e498cfd","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"Plan: Port the orchestrator role from tripn-astro with the ASES git deviation.\n\n1. **.opencode/agents/orchestrator.md** — port from tripn-astro, adapted to ASES: coordination-only primary agent; edit deny; bash allowlist = crosslink *, opencode models *, read-only git (status/diff/log/show/branch) + the two GATED git commands (commit/merge — required so the plugin-level active-issue gate is reachable, since the opencode matcher runs after plugin hooks and would otherwise deny merge outright), ls/cat/rtk; task allowlist builder/reviewer/auditor; question allow; webfetch/websearch deny.\n\n2. **.opencode/plugins/orchestrator-guard.ts** — port verbatim from tripn-astro (blocks write/edit/apply_patch/filesystem_write_file/filesystem_edit_file for all non-Builder agents via tool.execute.before; tracks agent via chat.params).\n\n3. **.opencode/opencode.json** — register orchestrator (mode: primary), add orchestrator-guard.ts to plugin list (before crosslink-guard, mirroring tripn-astro).\n\n4. **.crosslink/hook-config.json** — add agent_overrides.by_type.orchestrator: blocked_git_commands = the shared blocked list minus git merge (push/rebase/reset/force/clean/checkout ./restore ./stash/tag/am/apply/branch -d/-D/-m all remain blocked); gated_git_commands = [git commit, git merge] (active issue required). reviewer/auditor entries unchanged (full git-write blocking).\n\n5. **docs/ORCHESTRATOR.md** — add the four-role permission matrix (orchestrator: commit+merge gated, push blocked; builder: full; reviewer/auditor: read-only), replace stale static model names with model-resolved-at-runtime notes.\n\n6. **SESSION-START.md** — add role-routing pointers for the four roles + the permission matrix.\n\n7. **.opencode/permissions.md** — create (does not exist), mirroring tripn-astro's snapshot structure with the ASES git rule for orchestrator.\n\n8. **.crosslink/knowledge/agent-orchestration-playbook.md + crosslink-fork.md** — update 'orchestrator does NOT merge' statements to the ASES rule (commit+merge gated, push blocked); document by_type.orchestrator.\n\nVerification: JSON validity, tsc check on plugins. Will NOT run opencode (this change alters the current session's own permissions — a restart is required for the orchestrator role to take effect, noted in the result comment).","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:46:44.656715175Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAzSPa1sPxpyKoVOOByFukMgN5RaBLR1FGjluui23IhOS8DXcJOC2DEP65Jch39Nx5Hs9haxc8R5JoX+K52dXHAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFZM89tKg7u/l+9qmVflpNFwZP5FuNFJyPzzJg0IFeTgs+qJYesa1fTgtW0BBYmQj8qYx2lcHqqLrhCQA0dNMgw="}
